{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17624","headline":"郡中端居有怀袁州王员外使君 · 羊士谔","name":"郡中端居有怀袁州王员外使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆作同门友，承明奉直庐。\n禁闱人自异，休澣迹非疎。\n珥笔金华殿，三朝玉玺书。\n恩光荣侍从，文彩应符徐。\n青眼真知我，玄谈愧起予。\n兰巵招促膝，松砌引长裾。\n丽日流莺早，凉天坠露初。\n前山临紫阁，曲水眺红蕖。\n谁爲音尘旷，俄惊岁月除。\n风波移故辙，符守忽离居。\n济物阴功在，分忧盛业余。\n弱翁方大用，延首迟双鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}